{"id":"n72173-2-10","stage":2,"title":"큰길 · 大道","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72173-2-10-1","ko":"버스를 타려면 어디로 가야 하나요?","zh":"要坐公交车的话，应该去哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"버스를","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"타려면","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가야","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나요?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d26dc16439c23f001b3b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72173-2-10-2","ko":"이쪽으로 조금만 더 가면 큰길이 나올 거예요.","zh":"再往这边走一点，就会遇到大路了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이쪽으로","meaning":"这边","explanation":"이쪽：这边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"이쪽","audio":"/audio/ceea9a2e61410973dfd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71694","senseId":"1","lemma":"이쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가면","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"큰길이","meaning":"大道","explanation":"큰길：大道；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"큰길","audio":"/audio/319688b45ab65c19f38d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72173","senseId":"2","lemma":"큰길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나올","meaning":"出现，出来","explanation":"나오다：出现，出来；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"10","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ceea9a2e61410973","term":"이쪽","zh":"这边","audio":"/audio/ceea9a2e61410973dfd8.mp3","entryId":"71694","definition":"指代离说话人很近的地方或方向。","pronunciation":["이쪽"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"319688b45ab65c19","term":"큰길","zh":"大道","audio":"/audio/319688b45ab65c19f38d.mp3","entryId":"72173","definition":"来往的行人与车辆较多的大路。","pronunciation":["큰길"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现，出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"某个东西被发现或显现。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/9016a4924886e1f8d959.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.627,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72173","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":83,"sequenceScore":2.2804,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["要坐公交车的话，应该去哪儿呢？","再往这边走一点，就会遇到大路了。","听说你和男朋友因为宗教问题闹得很不愉快？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["要坐公交车的话，应该去哪儿呢？","再往这边走一点，就会遇到大路了。","听说你和男朋友因为宗教问题闹得很不愉快？"],"answer":1}]}
